      "width": 1020,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "To get a feature to DEV, you do exactly 3 things:\n\n  1. 👨‍💻 Write code + git push feature/*                              (your normal work)\n  2. 👨‍💻 Create MR: feature/* → main in App Repo                     (GitLab UI, one click)\n  3. 👨‍💻 Review + Merge that MR                                       (GitLab UI, one click)\n\n     → Everything else is automated. ~5 min later, your code runs on DEV.\n\nTo get it to PROD, one more step:\n  4. 👨‍💻 Review + Merge the prod MR in Environment Repo               (created automatically by CI)",
